# Playwright Conventions

## Auth        (from auth-strategy.md)
Stored session by default; UI login only for login-page tests.

## Page Objects (from pom-conventions)
One POM per page/component; locators in the constructor; no
assertions in POMs; tests describe intent.

## Locators
Role/label-based; never CSS selectors; never brittle text.

## Data & cleanup (from api-cleanup)
Unique data with Date.now(); every test cleans up after itself.
